# GBNF grammar for the two-pass style picker.
#
# Used by both Pass 1 (inventor) and Pass 2 (chooser) when the loader
# supports grammar-constrained decoding (llama.cpp / Ollama / vLLM
# guided decoding).
#
# Constrains output to lowercase snake_case 2-5 words. Same shape as
# the canonical 10 OTR style preset slugs (closed_room_suspense,
# noir_interrogation, etc.).
#
# Pass 1 emits 5 of these on separate lines; Pass 2 emits exactly 1.
# Line-separator orchestration is the loader's responsibility (stop
# token = blank line for Pass 1, "\n" for Pass 2).

root ::= word ("_" word){1,4}
word ::= [a-z]+
